                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "sweatings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63c7d3e9-85af-3852-8039-525c5ee49f5c",
                        "entry_id": "abc2effb-d762-3c4e-bb0c-65166280703d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The production and evaporation of a watery fluid called sweat that is excreted by the sweat glands in the skin of mammals."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "458a7e7f-cd35-41ab-afce-aeda5888c012",
                                "sense_id": "63c7d3e9-85af-3852-8039-525c5ee49f5c",
                                "text": "In its favour may be urged, I. That in healthy persons, in every case of increased action of the heart and arteries, a sweating takes place, and is, seemingly, the means of preventing the bad effects of such increased action."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec084880-4da0-4467-9f23-7ea5af9c8902",
                                "sense_id": "63c7d3e9-85af-3852-8039-525c5ee49f5c",
                                "text": "In this early stage there is generally a tendency to constipation of the bowels, and in the intervals between the sweatings the urine remains clear, though not abundant. In the second degree, the emaciation is more noticeable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe845a7f-ebab-4de7-b9c7-c3b48a815c80",
                                "sense_id": "63c7d3e9-85af-3852-8039-525c5ee49f5c",
                                "text": "Her jet-black hair would be heavily braided, and her face chalky-white from its coating of powder (she suffered from constant sweatings and seborrhoea)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e31a823-b356-3728-ad0c-b0bf802b0efd",
                        "entry_id": "abc2effb-d762-3c4e-bb0c-65166280703d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mucilage, especially of cocoa."
                        ],
